flowchart LR
  V[(S3 raw: mp4 + GPS)] --> Q[SQS jobs]
  Q --> W["Batch worker · EC2 Graviton<br/>OpenCV 5: decode → detect → blur → embed"]
  W --> D[(DynamoDB detections)]
  W --> C[(S3 crops)]
  D --> A["Agent API · FastAPI<br/>DBSCAN cluster → severity score → file / queue / dismiss"]
  A --> T[(DynamoDB tickets + traces)]
  T --> UI[React + Leaflet map and queue]
  UI -->|CSV / signed webhook| CITY[City work-order system]
  UI -->|human override| A
  CW[CloudWatch metrics] -.-> W
  CW -.-> A
